2. **Have you checked your Windows microphone privacy settings?** Windows 11 has strict privacy controls that can block apps from accessing the microphone, even if the volume is not muted.
3. **Have you tested the microphone in other apps or on a different device?** This will help determine if the issue is specific to your current machine or a more general problem with the microphone hardware.

