1. To raise an invoice for an existing product:
   - Go to Invoices > Raise Invoice
   - Select the product, enter the quantity, and choose the correct tax code
   - Add any remarks if applicable, then click Submit
   - Confirm the invoice appears under ''My Invoices'' with status ''Submitted''

2. To add a new product to the invoicing catalog:
   - Submit a product onboarding request with the product name, category, and applicable tax code
   - The Configuration team will review and add the product to the master data table
   - Allow up to 2 business days for the new product to appear across all invoicing screens
   - If the product does not appear as expected, raise a support ticket rather than resubmitting the request

