### 🧩 Recommended Action

It seems the "4K Webcam" product you need is not yet enabled in Meridian''s central invoicing catalog, which is why it''s missing from the dropdown list when trying to raise an invoice.

To resolve this, I recommend submitting a product onboarding request to have the "4K Webcam" added to the master catalog:

1. Gather the product details like name ("4K Webcam"), category (e.g. Peripherals), and applicable tax code.

2. Submit a new product onboarding request with these details through the standard process.

